{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23409","headline":"葺池上旧亭 · 白居易","name":"葺池上旧亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池月夜凄凉，池风晓萧飒。\n欲入池上冬，先葺池上合。\n向暖窗户开，迎寒帘幕合。\n苔封旧瓦木，水照新朱蜡。\n软火深土炉，香醪小瓷榼。\n中有独宿翁，一灯对一榻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}